    "Most traffic is image downloads. Should those ever reach your servers?",
    "Thumbnails are slow to make: accept the upload, then generate them in the background.",
    "CloudFront → LB (2) → API (8) → Redis (2) → NoSQL (2); API → SQS → thumbnailers (2) → S3, and API → S3."
